# Calls at 12-14 carry a literal with no specifier. 20-24 must not fire: specifier, escaped %% (still a format string), non-literal, concatenation (known FP shape skipped), percent only in args.
format-string-not-formatted 12
format-string-not-formatted 13
format-string-not-formatted 14
!format-string-not-formatted 20
!format-string-not-formatted 21
!format-string-not-formatted 22
!format-string-not-formatted 23
!format-string-not-formatted 24
